4. No credentials in this repository
------------------------------------

This repository contains **no passwords and no password hashes**.

- Documentation, release notes and the test suite use `<password>` placeholders;
  the test suite reads the board password from the `XVC_PASSWORD` environment
  variable instead of hard-coding it.
- `petalinux-image-minimal.bbappend` ships a deliberately invalid hash, so a
  freshly built image boots but no account can log in. Set your own before
  building — see `xvc/docs/MANUFACTURING.md` section 8.4.
- If you forked or cloned this repository before this change, treat the
  credentials that used to be published here as compromised and rotate them.

